## Ticket Workflow

### Ticket Lifecycle

| Status | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| New | Ticket created, awaiting triage |
| Open | Assigned, work in progress |
| Pending | Awaiting customer response |
| On Hold | Waiting for third party |
| Escalated | Escalated to higher tier |
| Resolved | Solution provided |
| Closed | Customer confirmed, ticket closed |

### Standard Process

| Step | Action | Owner |
|------|--------|-------|
| 1 | Ticket received, auto-acknowledged | System |
| 2 | Triage and prioritize | Tier 1 |
| 3 | Initial response | Tier 1/2 |
| 4 | Investigation and diagnosis | Assigned tier |
| 5 | Resolution or escalation | Assigned tier |
| 6 | Customer verification | Support |
| 7 | Close and survey | System |

